### Messages - Create

POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}",
  "room_id": "{{roomId}}",
  "room_kind": "{{roomKind}}",
  "author_id": "{{authorId}}",
  "body": "{{body}}",
  "parent_id": "{{parentId}}",
  "attachments": {{attachments}},
  "mention_ids": {{mentionIds}}
}
